{"seq":2,"slug":"evidence-based-nursing","title":"大学护理学 — 循证护理实践","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/nursing/nursing-research/evidence-based-nursing","wordCount":2213,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学护理学-循证护理实践\">大学护理学 — 循证护理实践</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>循证护理（Evidence-Based Nursing，EBN）是将最佳研究证据、临床专业知识和患者价值偏好三者有机整合，用于指导护理临床决策的系统化方法。循证护理的兴起源于一个朴素的质疑——&quot;我们日常执行的护理操作，有多少是真正被科学证据支持的？&quot;研究发现，许多传统护理常规（如术后强制禁食至排气、常规灌肠准备）缺乏充分的科学依据，甚至可能对患者有害。循证实践推动护理从&quot;这是我们一直以来的做法&quot;转向&quot;这是证据支持的最佳做法&quot;。</p>\n<p>核心方法框架：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>循证实践的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 步骤</strong>：Ask、Acquire、Appraise、Apply、Assess</li>\n<li><strong>证据层级与评价</strong>：从系统评价到专家意见的证据等级体系</li>\n<li><strong>系统评价方法</strong>：Meta 分析和质性研究综合</li>\n<li><strong>证据转化</strong>：从研究发现到临床护理方案的转化实施</li>\n<li><strong>临床实践指南</strong>：基于证据的护理标准和实践建议</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-循证护理的三大支柱\">一、循证护理的三大支柱</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[循证护理决策] --&gt; B[最佳研究证据]&#10;    A --&gt; C[临床专业知识]&#10;    A --&gt; D[患者价值与偏好]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[系统评价/RCT/观察性研究]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[临床判断/经验/技能]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[患者需求/文化/期望]\">graph TD\n    A[循证护理决策] --&gt; B[最佳研究证据]\n    A --&gt; C[临床专业知识]\n    A --&gt; D[患者价值与偏好]\n    B --&gt; B1[系统评价/RCT/观察性研究]\n    C --&gt; C1[临床判断/经验/技能]\n    D --&gt; D1[患者需求/文化/期望]</pre><p>三者缺一不可：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>仅有研究证据而忽视临床情境，可能导致机械照搬无法落地</li>\n<li>仅凭临床经验而无证据支持，可能延续无效甚至有害的做法</li>\n<li>忽视患者偏好，再好的证据也无法转化为患者接受的护理方案</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"二-循证实践的-5a-步骤\">二、循证实践的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 步骤</h3><p><strong>Step 1: Ask（提出问题）</strong></p>\n<p>将临床困惑转化为结构化的可检索问题。根据问题类型选择不同的 PICO 变体：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>问题类型</th>\n<th>适用格式</th>\n<th>实例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>治疗/干预</td>\n<td>PICO</td>\n<td>&quot;对压疮高风险患者，使用泡沫敷料 vs. 标准翻身是否能降低压疮发生率？&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>诊断/评估</td>\n<td>PIT</td>\n<td>&quot;对老年住院患者，Morse 跌倒量表的灵敏度和特异度如何？&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预后</td>\n<td>PIO</td>\n<td>&quot;脑卒中后 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span></span> 个月内，哪些因素预测步行功能恢复？&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>体验/意义</td>\n<td>PICo</td>\n<td>&quot;ICU 转出患者的心理过渡体验是什么？&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>Step 2: Acquire（获取证据）</strong></p>\n<p>系统检索相关研究文献。检索策略遵循&quot;从最高级证据向下&quot;的原则：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Cochrane Library</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>JBI</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>PubMed</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>CINAHL</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>CNKI</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Cochrane Library} \\rightarrow \\text{JBI} \\rightarrow \\text{PubMed} \\rightarrow \\text{CINAHL} \\rightarrow \\text{CNKI}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Cochrane Library</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">JBI</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PubMed</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CINAHL</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CNKI</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>先查系统评价/Meta 分析，如果有高质量的系统评价已回答了该问题，则无需逐一检索原始研究。</p>\n<p><strong>Step 3: Appraise（评价证据）</strong></p>\n<p>使用标准化评价工具对证据质量进行批判性评价：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>研究类型</th>\n<th>评价工具</th>\n<th>关注重点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>RCT</td>\n<td>Cochrane RoB 工具</td>\n<td>随机化、盲法、失访处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>观察性研究</td>\n<td>Newcastle-Ottawa 量表</td>\n<td>选择偏倚、可比性、结局评估</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>质性研究</td>\n<td>JBI QARI 工具</td>\n<td>方法论一致性、研究者反身性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>系统评价</td>\n<td>AMSTAR 2</td>\n<td>方案注册、检索策略、异质性处理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>证据等级体系</strong>（JBI 分级）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>等级</th>\n<th>证据来源</th>\n<th>推荐强度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Level 1</td>\n<td>系统评价/Meta 分析</td>\n<td>最强</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Level 2</td>\n<td>随机对照试验</td>\n<td>强</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Level 3</td>\n<td>类实验性研究</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Level 4</td>\n<td>观察性研究（队列/病例对照）</td>\n<td>中弱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Level 5</td>\n<td>专家意见/描述性研究</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>Step 4: Apply（应用证据）</strong></p>\n<p>将评价后的最佳证据结合临床情境和患者偏好，转化为可执行的护理方案。转化过程中需要考虑：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>本机构的资源和条件</li>\n<li>护理团队的能力和接受度</li>\n<li>患者群体的特征是否与研究人群相符</li>\n<li>潜在的障碍和促进因素</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Step 5: Assess（评估效果）</strong></p>\n<p>实施循证方案后，评估其在本机构的实际效果。比较实施前后的护理质量指标变化，必要时进行调整。这使循证实践成为一个持续改进的循环。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三-系统评价与-meta-分析\">三、系统评价与 Meta 分析</h3><p>系统评价是循证护理的基石——它通过系统、全面地检索和综合所有相关研究，提供某一特定问题的最佳可得证据。</p>\n<p><strong>系统评价的标准流程</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>制定方案并注册（PROSPERO 注册平台）</li>\n<li>制定检索策略（至少检索 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 个数据库）</li>\n<li>文献筛选（两名研究者独立筛选，PRISMA 流程图报告）</li>\n<li>数据提取（标准化表格）</li>\n<li>质量评价</li>\n<li>数据合并（Meta 分析或叙述性综合）</li>\n<li>结果报告</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>Meta 分析</strong>将多个独立研究的结果量化合并。对于连续变量，使用加权均数差（WMD）或标准化均数差（SMD）；对于二分类变量，使用相对危险度（RR）或比值比（OR）。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>合并效应量</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{合并效应量} = \\frac{\\sum w_i \\times \\theta_i}{\\sum w_i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">合并效应量</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个研究的权重（通常为方差的倒数），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个研究的效应量。</p>\n<p><strong>异质性评估</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 统计量衡量研究间变异的百分比。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I^2 &lt; 25\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8532em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25%</span></span></span></span></span> 为低异质性，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>∼</mo><mn>75</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">25\\% \\sim 75\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">75%</span></span></span></span></span> 为中度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>75</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 75\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">75%</span></span></span></span></span> 为高异质性。高异质性时需探索异质性来源（亚组分析、Meta 回归），可能不适合合并。</p>\n<h3 id=\"四-证据转化模型\">四、证据转化模型</h3><p><strong>JBI 循证护理实践模型</strong>将证据转化分为三个阶段：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>工具</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>证据生成</td>\n<td>原始研究和系统评价</td>\n<td>JBI 方法学手册</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>证据综合</td>\n<td>系统评价和证据总结</td>\n<td>JBI 证据等级系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>证据转化</td>\n<td>将证据应用于实践改进</td>\n<td>JBI PACES/GRiP 审查工具</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>**基于证据的质量改进项目（Evidence-Based Quality Improvement，EBQI）**的典型流程：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>组建多学科循证实践小组</li>\n<li>识别临床问题并检索最佳证据</li>\n<li>开展基线审查——当前实践与最佳证据的差距分析</li>\n<li>制定循证护理方案（包括护理流程图和培训计划）</li>\n<li>实施方案（试点科室→全院推广）</li>\n<li>实施后审查——评估指标改善程度</li>\n<li>持续监测——将循证方案嵌入常规质量管理</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"五-临床实践指南的使用\">五、临床实践指南的使用</h3><p>临床实践指南（Clinical Practice Guidelines，CPG）是基于系统评价证据、经专家小组讨论后形成的推荐意见。护士在使用指南时应关注：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>指南质量评价</strong>：使用 AGREE II 工具评估指南的范围目的、参与人员、制定严谨性、表达清晰性、适用性和编辑独立性</li>\n<li><strong>推荐强度</strong>：GRADE 系统将推荐分为强推荐和弱推荐（或条件推荐）</li>\n<li><strong>更新时效</strong>：指南通常 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3 \\sim 5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 年需要更新，使用过时的指南可能不反映最新证据</li>\n<li><strong>本土化适应</strong>：国际指南需要结合本国医疗资源和患者特征进行适应性调整</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>你发现科室中仍然对所有术前患者常规进行灌肠准备。使用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 步骤设计一个循证实践改进项目，从提出问题到评估效果。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>一篇 Meta 分析纳入了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span> 项 RCT，合并效应量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.65</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RR = 0.65</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.65</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>95</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">95\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">95%</span></span></span></span></span> CI: <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.48</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>0.88</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.48 \\sim 0.88</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.48</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.88</span></span></span></span></span>），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>72</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I^2 = 72\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">72%</span></span></span></span></span>。解读这个结果——干预是否有效？异质性如何处理？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>讨论为什么&quot;这是我们科室一直以来的做法&quot;不应该成为继续一项护理操作的充分理由。举出一个曾经被广泛使用后来被证据推翻的护理常规。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>比较 JBI 和 Cochrane 两个循证护理组织在证据生成、综合和转化方面的各自优势。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>你计划在科室推广一项基于证据的压疮预防方案，但遇到护士抵触（&quot;太麻烦了&quot;&quot;以前的方法也没什么问题&quot;）。讨论证据转化中的障碍以及克服策略。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>《循证护理学》</strong>（胡雁主编）：国内循证护理核心教材</li>\n<li><strong>&quot;Evidence-Based Practice in Nursing &amp; Healthcare&quot; (Melnyk &amp; Fineout-Overholt)</strong>：全球最畅销的循证护理教材</li>\n<li><strong>Cochrane Library</strong> (<a href=\"https://www.cochranelibrary.com)：系统评价数据库\">https://www.cochranelibrary.com)：系统评价数据库</a></li>\n<li><strong>JBI (Joanna Briggs Institute)</strong> (<a href=\"https://jbi.global)：护理循证实践的全球领导者\">https://jbi.global)：护理循证实践的全球领导者</a></li>\n<li><strong>GRADE Handbook</strong>：证据质量评价和推荐强度方法学</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>循证护理是护理实践走向科学化、标准化的必由之路。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 步骤提供了从临床问题到实践改进的完整路径，证据等级体系帮助护士判断不同来源证据的可信程度。系统评价和 Meta 分析是证据金字塔的顶端，为临床决策提供最可靠的依据。证据转化模型则确保研究发现能够真正改变护理实践，而非停留在论文中。循证思维不仅是一种研究方法，更是一种护理文化——质疑传统、寻求证据、持续改进。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学护理学 — 循证护理实践","id":"大学护理学-循证护理实践"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一、循证护理的三大支柱","id":"一-循证护理的三大支柱"},{"level":3,"text":"二、循证实践的 5A 步骤","id":"二-循证实践的-5a-步骤"},{"level":3,"text":"三、系统评价与 Meta 分析","id":"三-系统评价与-meta-分析"},{"level":3,"text":"四、证据转化模型","id":"四-证据转化模型"},{"level":3,"text":"五、临床实践指南的使用","id":"五-临床实践指南的使用"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学护理学 — 护理研究方法论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/nursing/nursing-research/research-methodology"},"next":{"title":"大学护理学 — 护理信息学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/nursing/nursing-research/nursing-informatics"}}